    "title": "Cardiovascular Events and Correlates in the Veterans Affairs Diabetes Feasibility Trial",
    "authors": "Carlos Abraira, MD; John Colwell, MD, PhD; Frank Nuttall, MD, PhD; Clark T. Sawin, MD; William Henderson, PhD; John P. Comstock, MD; Nicholas V. Emanuele, MD; Seymour R. Levin, MD; Ivan Pacold, MD; Hae Sook Lee; and the Veterans Affairs Cooperative Study on Glycemic Control and Complications in Type II Diabetes (VACSDM) Group",
